      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "That's something you can add to your Avatar in Unity, at least on PC. Most PC VR players use tools like OVR Toolkit or XS Overlay to do the same.\nIf you are on Quest I don't think there is a way to get that at the moment because of shader limitations, so maybe adding the time to the Quick Menu could be an idea. I don't think a wrist menu should only be there to display the time.",
